== About this portal ==
This portal is a reader-facing view over the knowledge corpus. It does not define the ontology and does not imply that the domain is exclusive. A knowledge object may belong to multiple domains.

Subportals are recursive navigation views. A focused portal may cross more than one Domain; portal parentage does not create semantic inheritance.

See [[BITwiki:Navigation]], [[BITwiki:Organization]], [[BITwiki:Readable depth and localization]], and [[BITwiki:Semantic properties]].

